                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Healthcare is getting even more expensive in California because of the Big, Bloated, Borrowing Budget Bill. An estimated 1.7 million Californians will see their health insurance premiums skyrocket by 66% in 2026. I\u2019ll fight to extend premium tax credits and keep care affordable. https://t.co/d2LqrlPA0g",
